'''Agatha''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{Zone|Murkwater Loch}} on {{Zone|Moonglade Marsh}} that hosts the island's [[Starlyn Contest]]s.

== Contests ==
{{Main|Starlyn Contest}}
'''Agatha''' hosts a contest that takes place every SkyBlock Day and lasts for {{Green|20}} real-life minutes. During the contest, a player can gain points through various means.

== Shop ==
'''Agatha's''' Shop has {{Green|5}} milestones, which are progressed by collecting {{Item|Agatha's Coupon}}s. Each contest awards a certain amount of {{Item|Agatha's Coupon}}s based on rarity.

