== Notes ==
*'''Agatha''' will only keep your rewards from previous contests for one Skyblock year.
== Trivia ==
*It costs {{BZC|4750 AGATHA_COUPON|2148 Enchanted Fig Log|286 Figstone|10 Agatha's Prize}} to max out [[Fig Log|Fig]] Fortune, and {{BZC|4750 AGATHA_COUPON|2148 Enchanted Mangrove Log|286 Mangcore|10 Agatha's Prize}} for [[Mangrove Log|Mangrove]] Fortune.
**This comes out to a total of {{BZC|9500 AGATHA_COUPON|2148 Enchanted Fig Log|286 Figstone|2148 Enchanted Mangrove Log|286 Mangcore|20 Agatha's Prize}} if a player wishes to max out both.
*To reach Milestone {{Orange|V}}, it would take {{Green|100}} {{Rarity|Legendary}} placement in the [[Starlyn Contest]], which will take {{Green|33}} hours.
**With {{Rarity|Mythic}}, {{Rarity|Divine}} and {{Rarity|Special}} placements, it would take {{Green|29}}, {{Green|25}} and {{Green|22}} hours, respectively.
*Collecting '''Agatha's''' [[Abiphones#Contacts|{{Aqua|Abiphone Contact}}]] before unlocking her contests allows the player to call her and open the menu.

